# Pairs with RetainedRestorable. An increment checks and publishes without
# first writing its sink manifest, so a pass's scan cannot see an increment
# in flight, and the fence between them is gone.
MODULE: RetainedRestorableManifestNotWritten
TARGET: RetainedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an increment's sink manifest is not written before the check
PERTURBS: WriteMan

--- FIND
    /\ snk' = snk \cup {cap[c].id}
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![c].ph = "man"]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: an increment's sink manifest is not written.
    /\ snk' = IF meta[cap[c].id].kind = "incr" THEN snk ELSE snk \cup {cap[c].id}
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![c].ph = "man"]
--- END